# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

inventory is project
inventory purpose "Use the stock module's map by qualified names; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
inventory target console
inventory version "0.1.0"
inventory language refined 1
inventory standardLibrary 1
inventory allows write console.stdout none
inventory requires none
inventory includesModule stock
inventory includesModule shop
inventory entry shop.main
